97101", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624656_2383363855530434_7671277500057000994_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VdXWw_-tjcwQ7kNvwFL3reJ&_nc_oc=AdrvpbHjf1SUoLWMaUQ7-k35S98D0v7BjzW4D9Hg3DDeTU7b1VPBL5a32AeEHLDqdkM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRYI7eu48tD9fg7gyiw9ytBkV3vkDAZpImyjH4r859N3Q&oe=6AE76FCE"}, {"file_name": "ITM 1.png", "id": "1097218096222251", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593845024_1097218099555584_4100225344608675206_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rSn3TLN2_s8Q7kNvwHx7bu7&_nc_oc=AdqizztYEePQxzqiFXPgTg6o_3SIF5qyCCKfDD3X9kjBjQtn86cUwUsTGzfVpxjqRXE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS7brQ3sQs7WHApjgUyVCX7BuN18lDw234HYl261Da1BQ&oe=6AE74807"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Theme Park Main Thumbnail Yellow.png", "id": "2179041389662333", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624577_2179041392995666_4007083605745280473_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f1bBp8nyK_YQ7kNvwHP4yhM&_nc_oc=AdrwFrFu6imGaMcSPlpVJsSXUGc2DaaXLi-NY0-H0CVj2DR9X9W43O75D7l4DaC2OZw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTjW4IFNt06mQm2CpSVgpTkDaEvPWCQlLCM1-R0SM_rZg&oe=6AE73D01"}, "display_name": "Theme Park: Dark Rides & Games", "keywords": ["ride", "coop", "darkride", "themepark", "magical"], "long_description": "MAJOR  UPDATE OCTOBER 2026 (10GB of new content) \nTry before you buy.\n\nTL;DR A Theme Park currently being Imagineered but already with 2 highly detailed long format dark rides, with optional, but satisfying games. Hours of fun! \n\nThis app is all about the experience of exploring a Theme Park, discovering its interactive elements and of course getting on highly detailed dark rides solo, or with friends & family. The Park is still being Imagineered, but there are already hours of content to be enjoyed and discovered. Plus you can look forward to free updates as I grow the park so come back every year or so.\n\nThe flagship attractions presently are Act 1 of 'Into the Metaverse,' a 14.5 minute dark ride showcasing humanity\u2019s quest throughout history for ever deeper immersion and a sneak peek of the 26 minute, 75% complete 'The Haunted Castle', the biggest dark ride ever created. \n\nThese are high effort, extremely polished rides with narration, music, hundreds of audio animatronics, massive sets and all the trimmings you would expect at a real Theme Park. A lot of effort has gone into the app to make it a seamless experience without any loading screens or other immersion breaking limitations. This app is not a game, but there are some game elements to be unlocked for those interested but they are not a requirement.\n\nIf you miss being in a Theme Park, then this is the app for you. \n\nSee you in the park soon,\nImmersive Matthew\nImagineer\n\nDiscord Server\nhttps://discord.gg/hdx8TP29Aw", "short_description": "MAJOR  UPDATE OCTOBER 2026 (10GB of new content)\nWish you were in a Theme Park right now? Exploring the grounds,  interactive elements and of course getting on highly detailed dark rides solo,or with friends and family. This is the goal of the app and I am excited for you to discover it as you really will feel like you are in one. The park is still being imagineered, but there are already hours of content to be enjoyed including 2 massive darkrides plus more. Enjoy solo or with friends & family."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "972750528588114", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u540d \u30c6\u30fc\u30de\u30d1\u30fc\u30af\u30e9\u30a4\u30c9\uff1a\u30e1\u30bf\u30d0\u30fc\u30b9\u306e\u4e16\u754c\u3078\uff08DEMO\uff09", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u300cInto the Metaverse\u300d\u306f\u3001\u904e\u53bb\u3001\u73fe\u5728\u3001\u672a\u6765\u306e\u30b7\u30fc\u30f3\u3